#: ../../source/docs/common-ntf-devices.rst:48
#: c5a4f1e4247348f1ab95789bc2e3a67b
msgid "OLED Displays"
msgstr "OLED 显示屏"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ntf-devices.rst:50
#: fd23308628e249a7a87a6a19fa9ca2c6
msgid ""
"In addition, two I2C connected OLED Displays are supported which display key"
" autopilot status and status text messages: SSH1106 and SSD1306 compatible "
"displays. These will display the text messages normally sent to a Ground "
"Control Station, as well as some status information."
msgstr ""
"此外，还支持两种 I2C 连接的 OLED 显示屏，可显示关键飞控状态和状态文本消息：SSH1106 和 SSD1306 "
"兼容显示屏。它们将显示通常发送到地面控制站的文本消息以及一些状态信息。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ntf-devices.rst:55
#: 0599df9c64da480b92f16f54b757e6ed
msgid ""
"These are enabled via the :ref:`NTF_DISPLAY_TYPE<NTF_DISPLAY_TYPE>` "
"parameter."
msgstr "通过 :ref:`NTF_DISPLAY_TYPE<NTF_DISPLAY_TYPE>` 参数启用这些显示屏。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ntf-devices.rst:58
