#: ../../source/docs/common-ntf-devices.rst:60
#: 0f93a06e2f87467dbe1c4b3c7d5702c3
msgid ""
"Buzzers can provide aural indications of status and warnings. Examples for a"
" external piezo buzzer used with a Pixhawk are given :ref:`here <common-"
"sounds-pixhawkpx4>`."
msgstr ""
"蜂鸣器可提供状态和警告的声音指示。使用 Pixhawk 的外部压电蜂鸣器示例请参阅 :ref:`此处 <common-sounds-"
"pixhawkpx4>`。"

